    <briefdescription>
<para>Minimal RIFF/WAV reader. Supports 16-bit PCM and 32-bit float WAV. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>No external library dependency. If the file is not a valid WAV, <ref refid="classthemis_1_1whisper_1_1_wav_audio_chunk_reader_1ad94a17de7838c64c9d5207a3ecd21116" kindref="member">readFile()</ref> throws std::runtime_error. </para>
